1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
夜里最馋的那锅粥
The congee you crave at midnight

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
潮汕人不叫粥，叫"糜"
In Chaoshan it's not zhou — it's "muê"

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
生米现熬，熬到米粒开花
Raw rice simmered till the grains bloom

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,100
火候一到，海鲜整只下锅
At the right heat, whole seafood goes in

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,400
螃蟹鲜虾，鲜味全熬进粥里
Crab and shrimp melt their sweetness in

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,700
米粒似烂非烂，海鲜还嫩
Rice half-broken, seafood still tender

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,000
这是潮汕夜宵的头牌
The star of Chaoshan's midnight table

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,300
潮汕话说"食糜"，一碗顶一夜
"Chia̍h muê" — one bowl gets you through the night

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,600
从伏羊的热，到酸汤的酸
From mutton's heat to sour soup's tang

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,900
从山野的鲜，到这碗海的鲜
From mountain umami to this sea-fresh bowl

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,000
四口地方味，你最想先吃哪一口？
Four flavors — which would you try first?

12
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,300
关注，带你吃遍下一座城
Follow — the next town's on the menu
